{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","舰炮轰击"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Cannon Fire"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌方英雄发射火炮，造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Hodgkin deals AoE damage by firing cannons at his enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","依次对所有敌方英雄发射1枚火炮，至少发射5枚火炮，火炮对1格范围内的敌人造成320% + 30% ATK伤害，对1格范围的友军造成100% ATK伤害，同一个角色重复受到2次以上的火炮伤害降低为20%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin fires a cannon at each enemy hero in sequence, dealing 320% + 30% ATK damage to the hit enemy and their adjacent enemies. Allies adjacent to the hit enemy will also take 100% ATK damage. If any unit is hit by the cannon more than twice, the damage from subsequent hits is reduced to 20%. Hodgkin can fire at least 5 cannons with this skill."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":67,"end":73,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":63,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":178,"end":186,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases cannon damage to 330% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至340% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases cannon damage to 340% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至350% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases cannon damage to 350% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至360% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases cannon damage to 360% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","复能灵御"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Phantom Respite"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入灵体状态，免疫物理伤害并回复生命。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Hodgkin enters an ethereal state, during which he is immune to physical damage and recovers HP."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使得自身进入8 + 0.5秒灵体状态，免疫所有物理伤害，期间每秒回复-70% − 10% ATK的生命值。被动地，释放终极技能时，立即使自身进入4秒灵体形态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin enters an ethereal state for 8 + 0.5s, during which he is immune to physical damage and recovers -70% − 10% ATK HP per second.\nPassive. When Hodgkin casts Cannon Fire, he immediately enters the ethereal state for 4s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":109,"end":115,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":105,"end":119,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-80% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Recovers -80% − 10% ATK HP per second during ethereal state."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-90% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Recovers -90% − 10% ATK HP per second during ethereal state."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-100% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Recovers -100% − 10% ATK HP per second during ethereal state."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","猎能横斩"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Rending Cleave"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对扇形范围敌人造成伤害并偷取能量。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Hodgkin deals damage to enemies within the radius of an arc and steals their Energy."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对2格扇形范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并偷取其70 + 5点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin deals 240% + 30% ATK damage to enemies within a 2-tile arc and steals 70 + 5 Energy from them."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":36,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":80,"end":84,"power_