ATK and Energy stolen to 100 + 5."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":65,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击，灵体状态期间额外提升自身攻击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Hodgkin increases his ATK, gaining an extra boost while in ethereal state."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升9%，灵体状态期间额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin increases his ATK by 9% during battle. His ATK increases by an extra 6% during his ethereal state."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升12%，灵体状态期间额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin increases his ATK by 12% during battle. His ATK increases by an extra 8% during his ethereal state."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升15%，灵体状态期间额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin increases his ATK by 15% during battle. His ATK increases by an extra 10% during his ethereal state."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","忠实拥趸"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Ardent Believers"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤死潮鲨鱼勾手加入战斗，被击败时造成范围伤害并削减能量。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Hodgkin summons Dead Tide Warriors into the battle, dealing AoE damage and reducing enemies' Energy upon defeat."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，霍德希金在身边召唤2个携带“亡灵秘法”的“死潮鲨鱼勾手”，继承自身60%的生命值和100%的其他属性，且只会普通攻击。携带“亡灵秘法”的角色阵亡时，会产生一次强烈的爆炸，对1格范围内的敌人造成120% ATK的伤害，还会附加携带者最大生命值10%的伤害，附加伤害最高不超过霍德希金200% ATK，并且还会使命中的敌人损失200点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin summons 2 Dead Tide Warriors affected by voidbound magic around him when a battle begins, each inheriting 60% of his HP and 100% of his other stats, and can only launch normal attacks. When a unit affected by voidbound magic is defeated, they trigger an explosion that deals damage equal to 120% ATK plus an extra 10% of the defeated unit's max HP to the adjacent enemies. This extra damage cannot exceed 200% ATK of Hodgkin's ATK. The targeted enemies also lose 200 Energy."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":102,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":146,"end":154,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":299,"end":307,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":413,"end":421,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“亡灵秘法”爆炸造成的伤害提高至140% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases explosion damage to 140% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","舰炮轰击命中未携带“亡灵秘法”的角色时，霍德希金会对其施加“亡灵秘法”，通过这个方式施加的“亡灵秘法”产生爆炸扣除的能量降低至70%。此外，舰炮轰击的伤害范围内如果有可破坏的墙体，还会对墙体也施加“亡灵秘法”。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Applies voidbound magic to any unit hit by Cannon Fire that does not already have it. The energy loss from this kind of explosion is reduced to 70%. The skill also applies voidbound magic to Breakable Walls within range."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“亡灵秘法”爆炸造成的伤害提高至160% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases explosion damage to 160% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","炮击命中敌人时，降低其护甲。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Hodgkin reduces the Phys DEF of enemies hit by the cannon."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","炮击命中的敌人会降低-15%护甲，可叠加2层，持续10秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin reduces the Phys DEF of enemies hit by the cannon by -15%, up to 2 stacks, for 10s."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得400点初始能量，在释放“舰炮轰击”期间，若一名敌人受到至少2次炮击伤害，则自身额外回复150点能量并使该名敌人在10秒内降低80点受愈。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Hodgkin gains 400 initial Energy. During Cannon Fire, for each enemy hit by the cannon at least 2 times, he recovers 150 Energy and reduces that enemy's Vitality by 80 for 10s."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","铁臂狂钩"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Dread Hook"]]}